export const SyncFrequencyOption = Schema.Struct({ "cadence": Schema.Literals(["15min", "30min", "1hour", "6hour", "12hour", "24hour", "7day", "30day"]).annotate({ "description": "* `15min` - 15min\n* `30min` - 30min\n* `1hour` - 1hour\n* `6hour` - 6hour\n* `12hour` - 12hour\n* `24hour` - 24hour\n* `7day` - 7day\n* `30day` - 30day" }), "allowed": Schema.Boolean.annotate({ "description": "False when writing this cadence would be rejected." }), "blocked_by": Schema.Union([SyncFrequencyBlockedByEnum, NullEnum], { mode: "oneOf" }).annotate({ "description": "Which side withholds this cadence: 'source' when no upstream source syncs that often, 'consumer' when a downstream view or endpoint refreshes more often than this. Null when the cadence is allowed.\n\n* `source` - source\n* `consumer` - consumer" }), "blocker": Schema.Union([SyncFrequencyBlocker, Schema.Null], { mode: "oneOf" }).annotate({ "description": "The source or consumer named in `blocked_by`. Null when allowed, and also when the blocker sits outside the caller's access grants, where `blocked_by` still gives the direction." }) })
